!mf!"^(M.M. to 108.)""^Stretch between the fifth and fourth fingers of the left hand in ascending, and the fifth and fourth fingers of\nthe right hand in descending." !1!C,/!2!E,/!3!F,/!4!G,/!5!A,/G,/F,/E,/ | !1!D,/!2!F,/!3!G,/!4!A,/!5!B,/A,/G,/F,/ | !1!E,/!2!G,/A,/B,/C/B,/A,/G,/ | !1!F,/!2!A,/B,/C/D/C/B,/A,/ | !1!G,/!2!B,/C/D/E/D/C/B,/ | !1!A,/!2!C/D/E/F/E/D/C/ | !1!B,/!2!D/E/F/G/F/E/D/ | !1!C/!2!E/F/G/A/G/F/E/ | !1!D/!2!F/G/A/B/A/G/F/ | !1!E/!2!G/A/B/c/B/A/G/ | !1!F/!2!A/B/c/d/c/B/A/ | G/B/c/d/e/d/c/B/ | A/c/d/e/f/e/d/c/ | B/d/e/f/g/f/e/d/ || !5!g/!4!e/!3!d/!2!c/!1!B/c/d/e/ | !5!f/!4!d/c/B/A/B/c/d/ | !5!e/!4!c/B/A/G/A/B/c/ | !5!d/!4!B/A/G/F/G/A/B/ | !5!c/!4!A/G/F/E/F/G/A/ | !5!B/!4!G/F/E/D/E/F/G/ | !5!A/!4!F/E/D/C/D/E/F/ | !5!G/!4!E/D/C/B,/C/D/E/ | !5!F/!4!D/C/B,/A,/B,/C/D/ | !5!E/!4!C/B,/A,/G,/A,/B,/C/ | !5!D/!4!B,/A,/G,/F,/G,/A,/B,/ | !5!C/!4!A,/G,/F,/E,/F,/G,/A,/ | !5!B,/!4!G,/F,/E,/D,/E,/F,/G,/ | !5!A,/!4!F,/E,/D,/C,/D,/E,/F,/ | !5!G,/!4!E,/D,/C,/B,,/C,/D,/E,/ :| C,4 |] [M:2/4]"^(1)" !1!C,/!2!E,/!5!A,/!4!G,/!3!F,/!4!G,/!3!F,/!2!E,/ | !1!D,/!2!F,/!5!B,/A,/G,/A,/G,/F,/ | !1!E,/!2!G,/!5!C/B,/A,/B,/A,/G,/ | !1!F,/!2!A,/D/C/B,/C/B,/A,/ | !1!G,/!2!B,/E/D/C/D/C/B,/ | !1!A,/!2!C/F/E/D/E/D/C/ | !1!B,/!2!D/G/F/E/F/E/D/ | !1!C/!2!E/A/G/F/G/F/E/ | !1!D/!2!F/B/A/G/A/G/F/ | !1!E/!2!G/c/B/A/B/A/G/ | !1!F/!2!A/d/c/B/c/B/A/ | !1!G/!2!B/e/d/c/d/c/B/ | !1!A/!2!c/f/e/d/e/d/c/ | !1!B/!2!d/g/f/e/f/e/d/ || "^(1)" !5!g/!2!d/!1!B/!2!c/!3!d/!2!c/!3!d/!4!e/ | !5!f/!2!c/!1!A/B/c/B/c/d/ | !5!e/!2!B/!1!G/A/B/A/B/c/ | !5!d/!2!A/!1!F/G/A/G/A/B/ | !5!c/!2!G/!1!E/F/G/F/G/A/ | !5!B/!2!F/!1!D/E/F/E/F/G/ | !5!A/!2!E/!1!C/D/E/D/E/F/ | !5!G/!2!D/!1!B,/C/D/C/D/E/ | !5!F/!2!C/!1!A,/B,/C/B,/C/D/ | !5!E/!2!B,/G,/A,/B,/A,/B,/C/ | !5!D/!2!A,/F,/G,/A,/G,/A,/B,/ | !5!C/!2!G,/E,/F,/G,/F,/G,/A,/ | !5!B,/!2!F,/D,/E,/F,/E,/F,/G,/ | !5!A,/!2!E,/C,/D,/E,/D,/E,/F,/ :| C,4 |] [M:2/4] !1!C,/!2!E,/!5!A,/!4!G,/!3!F,/!2!E,/!3!F,/!4!G,/ | !1!D,/!2!F,/!5!B,/!4!A,/!3!G,/!2!F,/G,/A,/ | !1!E,/!2!G,/!5!C/B,/A,/G,/A,/B,/ | !1!F,/!2!A,/!5!D/C/B,/A,/B,/C/ | !1!G,/!2!B,/!5!E/D/C/B,/C/D/ | !1!A,/!2!C/!5!F/E/D/C/D/E/ | !1!B,/!2!D/!5!G/F/E/D/E/F/ | !1!C/!2!E/!5!A/G/F/E/F/G/ | !1!D/!2!F/B/A/G/F/G/A/ | !1!E/!2!G/c/B/A/G/A/B/ | !1!F/!2!A/d/c/B/A/B/c/ | !1!G/!2!B/e/d/c/B/c/d/ | !1!A/!2!c/f/e/d/c/d/e/ | !1!B/!2!d/g/f/e/d/e/f/ || !5!g/!2!d/!1!B/!2!c/!3!d/!4!e/!3!d/!2!c/ | !5!f/!2!c/!1!A/B/c/d/c/B/ | !5!e/!2!B/!1!G/A/B/c/B/A/ | !5!d/!2!A/!1!F/G/A/B/A/G/ | !5!c/!2!G/!1!E/F/G/A/G/F/ | !5!B/!2!F/!1!D/E/F/G/F/E/ | !5!A/!2!E/C/D/E/F/E/D/ | !5!G/!2!D/B,/C/D/E/D/C/ | !5!F/!2!C/A,/B,/C/D/C/B,/ | !5!E/!2!B,/G,/A,/B,/C/B,/A,/ | !5!D/!2!A,/F,/G,/A,/B,/A,/G,/ | !5!C/!2!G,/E,/F,/G,/A,/G,/F,/ | !5!B,/!2!F,/D,/E,/F,/G,/F,/E,/ | !5!A,/!2!E,/C,/D,/E,/F,/E,/D,/ :| C,4 |] [M:2/4]"^(3-4-5) (1) Special exercise for the 3rd, 4th and 5th fingers of the hand." !1!C,/!2!D,/!1!C,/!2!E,/!5!A,/G,/F,/E,/ | !1!D,/!2!E,/D,/!2!F,/!5!B,/A,/G,/F,/ | !1!E,/F,/E,/G,/C/B,/A,/G,/ | !1!F,/G,/F,/A,/D/C/B,/A,/ | !1!G,/A,/G,/B,/E/D/C/B,/ | !1!A,/B,/A,/C/F/E/D/C/ | !1!B,/C/B,/D/G/F/E/D/ | !1!C/D/C/E/A/G/F/E/ | !1!D/E/D/F/B/A/G/F/ | !1!E/F/E/G/c/B/A/G/ | !1!F/G/F/A/d/c/B/A/ | !1!G/A/G/B/e/d/c/B/ | !1!A/B/A/c/f/e/d/c/ | !1!B/c/B/d/g/f/e/d/ || !5!g/!4!f/!5!g/!2!d/!1!B/c/d/e/ | !5!f/!4!e/!5!f/!2!c/!1!A/B/c/d/ | !5!e/d/e/B/G/A/B/c/ | !5!d/c/d/A/F/G/A/B/ | !5!c/B/c/G/E/F/G/A/ | !5!B/A/B/F/D/E/F/G/ | !5!A/G/A/E/C/D/E/F/ | !5!G/F/G/D/B,/C/D/E/ | !5!F/E/F/C/A,/B,/C/D/ | !5!E/D/E/B,/G,/A,/B,/C/ | !5!D/C/D/A,/F,/G,/A,/B,/ | !5!C/B,/C/G,/E,/F,/G,/A,/ | !5!B,/A,/B,/F,/D,/E,/F,/G,/ | !5!A,/G,/A,/E,/C,/D,/E,/F,/ :| C,4 |] [M:2/4]"^(1-2-3-4-5) We repeat, that the fingers should be lifted high, and with precision, until this entire volume is mastered." !1!C,/!5!A,/!4!G,/!5!A,/!3!F,/!4!G,/!2!E,/!3!F,/ | !1!D,/!5!B,/!4!A,/!5!B,/!3!G,/!4!A,/!2!F,/!3!G,/ | !1!E,/C/B,/C/A,/B,/G,/A,/ | !1!F,/D/C/D/B,/C/A,/B,/ | !1!G,/E/D/E/C/D/B,/C/ | !1!A,/F/E/F/D/E/C/D/ | !1!B,/G/F/G/E/F/D/E/ | !1!C/A/G/A/F/G/E/F/ | !1!D/B/A/B/G/A/F/G/ | !1!E/c/B/c/A/B/G/A/ | !1!F/d/c/d/B/c/A/B